    <p>Hi! I’m <strong>Zhao Yiheng</strong>, a Master’s student at the School of Electrical and Electronic Engineering, <a href="https://www.ntu.edu.sg/">Nanyang Technological University</a>. I received my bachelor’s degree in Computer Science and Technology from <a href="https://www.hhu.edu.cn/">Hohai University</a>. My research interests include AIGC and AI Security.</p>
    <p>I work on robustness and adversarial attacks against multimodal large models and agents under the supervision of Prof. Jiang Xudong.</p>
